00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:33,920
So if you need to do something like propagate blockchain state from one machine to 2000

458
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:38,320
machines today, you have to send out 2000 copies of that data manually.

459
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:43,200
With multicast, you send out two copies of it and the network replicates the data in

460
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:45,040
