00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:59,840
We can also do things like insert precision timing into the network.

466
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:02,640
So you can do things like time align packets.

467
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:06,800
You can know exactly what time the packet hit the edge of the network.

